;; --- THE OVERFLOW LAWS ------------------------------------------------------------------
;; In the direction the run needs: a zero sign-xor test puts the result in
;; band. Each: the test on the sign bits (ov_bits), the out-of-band case
;; forces the operand signs, the range lemmas make the bits literal, and
;; the test computes to 1 against the premise's 0.

(claim ov_sub_lo
  (goal ((x Int) (y Int))
